abstract: |
  An agentic Python CLI application that leverages Grok (via the xAI API by
  default) or other OpenAI-compatible providers, together with Wikipedia and
  web search tools, to deliver tailored information about Linux distributions.
  Features offline/static mode without an API key, multi-provider key chain,
  rich terminal output, query history, embedded/IoT profile, and JSON output.
